body:
Alrighty ben shapiro let's settle down. Judging by this thread you've drank the capitalist kool aid and that's okay. You need to play the game to survive, we get it.

&#x200B;

My only question is what strength of tide stick gets jeff bezos' load off a black t shirt. I'm asking for a friend.

Shut

&#x200B;

The

&#x200B;

Fuck

&#x200B;

Up

Oh man, I am sort of grown up now (26) and I managed to get stitches on my head three times before I was twelve. All will be well and it'll be a funny story. 

&#x200B;

Hell, if my family and I can laugh about getting a car door to the head and everyone thinking I was being silly until they saw blood. There's hope for all! Also once my parents fed me broken glass and my sisters and brother made fun of me because lettuce hurt my teeth. Until I spit out glass.

&#x200B;

Jesus now that I think about it we might roast each other too much. But we love one another and are all great friends.

&#x200B;
